{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782341091_130176.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>《GTA6》普通版預購獎勵是《GTA6》本體，罪惡城懷舊內容包，GTA+一個月會員。終極版預購獎勵是《GTA6》本體，罪惡城懷舊內容包，GTA+一個月會員，終極版升級。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340907_312170_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>《GTA6》講述的是美國罪惡城傑森和露西婭心裏一直清楚，命運對他們不公。本應簡單的行動出了差錯，美國陽光最燦爛的地方向兩人展露出它最陰暗的一面，將他們捲入一場橫跨雷奧奈達的犯罪陰謀。若想活着逃出生天，他們比以往任何時候都更需要彼此依靠。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340907_690501_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340908_311721_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340908_725903_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340907_357632_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782341091_849998_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782341091_130176.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340907_312170_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340907_690501_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340908_311721_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340908_725903_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《GTA6》PS5/Xbox版港服預購開啓 568港幣起步\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782340907_357632_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-25T01:21:14.969071+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":13,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}